{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "撤销委托",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 74.4,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "回到开头的题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.702
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "答案是不安全。",
   "spoken": "答案是不安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 4.457
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "委托写在账户的链上代码里，独立于链下的提现系统。",
   "spoken": "委托写在账户的链上代码里，独立于链下的提现系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 4.84,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 4.932,
   "speechEnd": 9.657
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "在新的授权覆盖或者清零它之前，委托合约照样可以被调用。",
   "spoken": "在新的授权覆盖或者清零它之前，委托合约照样可以被掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 10.1,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 10.1,
   "speechEnd": 14.957
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "Binance 在 10 月 30 日 0 点 10 分，才把委托清零。",
   "spoken": "Binance 在 10 月 30 日 0 点 10 分，才把委托清零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 15.36,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 15.461,
   "speechEnd": 20.762
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "恶意委托在链上，存活了约 3 小时 50 分。",
   "spoken": "恶意委托在链上，存活了约 3 小时 50 分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 21.18,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 21.275,
   "speechEnd": 24.559
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "暂停提现，不等于撤销权限。",
   "spoken": "暂停提现，不等于撤销权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 25.0,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 25.0,
   "speechEnd": 27.347
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "交易所今天就能做三件事。",
   "spoken": "交易所今天就能做三件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 27.78,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 27.78,
   "speechEnd": 29.744
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "提前写好紧急撤销流程并且演练，把链上授权也算进去。",
   "spoken": "提前写好紧急撤销流程并且演练，把链上授权也算进去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 30.16,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 30.16,
   "speechEnd": 34.807
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "热钱包设余额上限，每条链单独熔断。",
   "spoken": "热钱包设余额上限，每条链单独熔断。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 35.26,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 35.26,
   "speechEnd": 38.633
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "签名策略覆盖全部交易类型，包括 EIP-7702 授权。",
   "spoken": "签名策略覆盖全部交易类型，包括 EIP-7702 授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 39.08,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 39.08,
   "speechEnd": 44.255
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "普通用户也有几件事。",
   "spoken": "普通用户也有几件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 44.66,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 44.66,
   "speechEnd": 46.309
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "充值前，确认交易所支持的代币合约地址和网络。",
   "spoken": "充值前，确认交易所支持的代币合约地址和网络。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 46.72,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 46.816,
   "speechEnd": 50.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "开启提币白名单和新地址冷却期，提币地址从地址簿里选。",
   "spoken": "开启提币白名单和新地址冷却期，提币地址从地址簿里选。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 51.26,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 51.355,
   "speechEnd": 56.79
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "来源不明的资金不要充进去，交易所要你补资料，只在官方 App 里处理。",
   "spoken": "来源不明的资金不要充进去，交易所要你补资料，只在官方 App 里楚理。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-14.wav",
   "start": 57.16,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 57.26,
   "speechEnd": 62.596
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-15",
   "text": "保管者要让签名只为真实的订单服务，检查站要拦住赃款，也别误伤普通人。",
   "spoken": "保管者要让签名只为真实的订单服务，检查站要拦住赃款，也别误伤普通人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-15.wav",
   "start": 63.06,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 63.156,
   "speechEnd": 70.065
  },
  {
